diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 0452fef..53c5e32 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -82,3 +82,12 @@ operation and acknowledge it through the recovery API; an agent request is not
 itself authorization to run a host command. Journal write errors suspend dispatch
 and stop workers; the controller stays queryable and retries persisting its pending
 state. Operator recovery follows once storage is healthy.
+
+### Required cleanup preservation
+
+`hooks.before_remove_required: true` makes a missing, failed or timed-out
+`before_remove` hook block workspace deletion, including recorded-path and SSH
+cleanup. Default `false` retains the existing best-effort behavior. Use a trusted
+hook that durably copies declared evidence outside the workspace and verifies its
+checksums before success. Failure retains the workspace; repair the cause and
+retry cleanup. Startup/reload uses the same policy.
